{
  "entries": [
    {
      "anchor_quote": "In the city of Oru, no one gave directions by pointing.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "place:oru",
      "names": [
        "Oru"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "place"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "The Registry called these sounds addresses.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "group:the_registry",
      "names": [
        "the Registry"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "group"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "Ivara Noll worked in the Vellum Hall, where addresses were copied onto strips of skin-thin bark and pinned to a map that had no north.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "person:ivara_noll",
      "names": [
        "Ivara Noll",
        "Ivara"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "person"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "Ivara Noll worked in the Vellum Hall, where addresses were copied onto strips of skin-thin bark and pinned to a map that had no north.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "place:vellum_hall",
      "names": [
        "Vellum Hall"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "place"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "Her desk stood beside the Mouth Room, a chamber inside the Hall where new rooms were asked to say what they were.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "place:mouth_room",
      "names": [
        "Mouth Room"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "place"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "Her desk stood beside the Mouth Room, a chamber inside the Hall where new rooms were asked to say what they were.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "object:bark_strip",
      "names": [
        "bark strip"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "object"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "\"Not a room,\" said Tovan Sere, listening with his left ear.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "person:tovan_sere",
      "names": [
        "Tovan Sere",
        "Tovan"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "person"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "At her elbow sat a red key, a long iron thing with a forked tooth.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "object:red_key",
      "names": [
        "red key"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "object"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "then that she had never entered the Understair.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "place:understair",
      "names": [
        "Understair"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "place"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "Across the aisle, Eren Vey sorted address strips by the pressure of their sound.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "person:eren_vey",
      "names": [
        "Eren Vey",
        "Eren"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "person"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "Three desks away, Eren Vell, a porter with the same narrow face and almost the same name, carried stacks of bark to the drying racks.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "person:eren_vell",
      "names": [
        "Eren Vell",
        "Eren"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "person"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "The city had sent a petition that morning: a room was missing from the Tin Orchard.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "place:tin_orchard",
      "names": [
        "Tin Orchard",
        "the Orchard"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "place"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "Somewhere among the trees was a little room called the Latch, where the Orchard's caretaker stored spare door hinges.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "place:the_latch",
      "names": [
        "the Latch"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "place"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "Eren Vell stopped at the Hall's outer door to hand her a parcel tied with blue thread.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "object:tin_box",
      "names": [
        "tin box"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "object"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "Eren Vell stopped at the Hall's outer door to hand her a parcel tied with blue thread.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "object:blue_thread",
      "names": [
        "blue thread"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "object"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "Ivara put the tin box in her satchel and kept the key in her cuff.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "object:satchel",
      "names": [
        "satchel"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "object"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "Nima Orrel, the Orchard keeper, came to meet them.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "person:nima_orrel",
      "names": [
        "Nima Orrel",
        "Nima"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "person"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "She wore a necklace of brass washers, one for each year she had lived in the Orchard.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "object:necklace_of_brass_washers",
      "names": [
        "necklace of brass washers"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "object"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "A single hinge lay in the center.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "object:hinge",
      "names": [
        "hinge"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "object"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "The Hall's sleeping gallery held thirty narrow bunks, each with a tag that named its occupant and one room they were permitted to dream in.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "place:sleeping_gallery",
      "names": [
        "sleeping gallery"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "place"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "The Hall's sleeping gallery held thirty narrow bunks, each with a tag that named its occupant and one room they were permitted to dream in.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "object:sleeping_tag",
      "names": [
        "sleeping tag"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "object"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "On the back, someone had written Alis Noll in faded red ink.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "person:alis_noll",
      "names": [
        "Alis Noll",
        "Alis"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "person"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "The letters reminded Ivara of her mother's old recipe sheets, but the hand was not Mara's.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "person:mara_noll",
      "names": [
        "Mara Noll",
        "Mara"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "person"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "Ivara went to her desk and searched the drawers for the sheet where Mara had recorded a recipe for shell milk.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "object:recipe_sheet",
      "names": [
        "recipe sheet"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "object"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "A new strip of bark had appeared by the Orchard's address. It bore no words, only a pair of small handprints.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "object:handprint_strip",
      "names": [
        "handprint strip"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "object"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "He studied it for a long while, then brought out a ledger with a cracked spine.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "object:ledger",
      "names": [
        "ledger"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "object"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "He stood outside it with a bone comb in his hand.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "object:bone_comb",
      "names": [
        "bone comb"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "object"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "Tovan claimed he had borrowed it from the Hall's collection of unwanted instruments.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "group:the_hall_s_collection_of_unwanted_instruments",
      "names": [
        "the Hall's collection of unwanted instruments"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "group"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "A small folded paper lay beneath the false bottom, tucked beside the map and thimble, though she had not opened the box.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "object:folded_paper",
      "names": [
        "folded paper"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "object"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "The passage narrowed into a room called the Sump, where discarded addresses were pressed into clay.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "place:sump",
      "names": [
        "Sump"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "place"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "In its center stood a stone basin.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "object:stone_basin",
      "names": [
        "stone basin"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "object"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "A little brass map lay within, folded into a square.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "object:brass_map",
      "names": [
        "brass map"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "object"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "Beneath the map, they found a glass thimble containing a black thread.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "object:glass_thimble",
      "names": [
        "glass thimble"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "object"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "Beneath the map, they found a glass thimble containing a black thread.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "object:black_thread",
      "names": [
        "black thread"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "object"
    },
    {
      "anchor_quote": "On the day it was placed in Ivara's hands, it had appeared beside his porter cart.",
      "fixture": false,
      "key": "object:porter_cart",
      "names": [
        "porter cart"
      ],
      "personas": [],
      "role": null,
      "species": null,
      "type": "object"
    }
  ],
